      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Q72",
      "answer": "Need an actual Sacred Site origin and all other nonnumeric source/target restrictions. Pay one Energy when using the Power, not card play. Numeric range-ignore modification carries to Repeat without another surcharge; explicit Repeat location overrides normal targeting.",
